## H2b decision completed, 22 November 2026

The user explicitly agreed to omit H2b from the paper and use the new unadjusted four-model H2 monthly figure. The [agreed decision and stronger rationale](../paper_storyline.md#agreed-figure-2-and-h2b-omission-22-november-2026) settle H2b's inclusion, figure and paper treatment. Its narrower, model-dependent contribution does not justify the additional assumptions, sentence/sample changes, explanation and page cost. The same-sample market-value adjustment changes the post-signing RoBERTa p-value from 0.1048 to 0.0482; interpretation and input overlap need qualifications beyond the central comparison. This is a scope/value judgement, not a conclusion that regression is invalid or a rejection solely because it was not taught. Preserve the exploratory code, findings and figures in the repository.

Omit H2b from manuscript Results, Methods, Discussion and sample wording. Under the explicit omission instruction, remove only its 793-signing sentence from the approved sample description, retaining the sentence as historical provenance and leaving all other sample wording and H1 passages unchanged. Remove its optional third figure and 0.15/0.30-page allocations; the released 0.45 pages are unallocated fit margin. No replacement analysis is selected or authorised. Earlier H2b walkthrough and plot proposals below are retained as history and are no longer required manuscript work.

